<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Finding the constant of integration in context</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[[[if test="is(ctx=0)"]]<p>Water flows into a tank at a school in Kitui. After \(t\) minutes the rate of flow is \(\dfrac{dV}{dt} = {@rate@}\) litres per minute. At \(t = 0\) the tank holds \({@V0@}\) litres.</p>[[else]]<p>A seedling at a tree nursery in Kakamega grows at \(\dfrac{dh}{dt} = {@rate@}\) cm per week, \(t\) weeks after planting. It was \({@V0@}\) cm tall when planted.</p>[[/if]]<p>(a) Find \({@Vs@}\) in terms of \(t\).</p><div>\({@Vs@} =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) Find \({@Vs@}\) when \(t = {@Tend@}\).</p><div>\({@Vs@} =\) [[input:ans2]] [[if test="is(ctx=0)"]]litres[[else]]cm[[/if]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Integrate the rate to get a formula with a constant, then use the starting value to find the constant.</p><p>(a) \[{@Vs@} = \int \left({@rate@}\right) dt = {@nov@} + c\]At \(t = 0\), \({@Vs@} = {@V0@}\), so \(c = {@V0@}\) and \({@Vs@} = {@ta1@}\).</p><p>(b) At \(t = {@Tend@}\): \({@Vs@} = {@ta2@}\) [[if test="is(ctx=0)"]]litres[[else]]cm[[/if]].</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[validate_tc(ex) := if every(lambda([v], member(v, [t, c, C])), listofvars(ex)) then "" else "Use t for time (and c for a constant of integration).";
/* Design: rate with a known value. [ctx, p, q, V0, Tend]: rate p + q*t; ctx 0 tank (litres, minutes), 1 seedling (cm, weeks). Source: adapted from SMP AS/A2 Core 1, chapter 10, Exercise D question 7. */
L: [[0,40,4,300,10],[0,25,6,500,8],[0,50,2,200,15],[0,30,4,650,12],[0,60,2,150,20],[1,2,1,5,6],[1,3,2,4,5],[1,1,2,8,7],[1,2,2,3,8],[1,3,1,6,4]];
ix: 1+rand(10);
ctx: L[ix][1]; pp: L[ix][2]; qq: L[ix][3]; V0: L[ix][4]; Tend: L[ix][5];
Vs: if is(ctx=0) then V else h;
rate: pp+qq*t;
ta1: V0+pp*t+qq/2*t^2;
ta2: subst(t=Tend, ta1);
/* diagnostics */
nov: pp*t+qq/2*t^2;
nodiv: V0+pp*t+qq*t^2;
flowed: subst(t=Tend, nov);
rateT: pp+qq*Tend;
nodivT: subst(t=Tend, nodiv);]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
